{
  "_provenance": "Research assumption for issue 2015, not a deployment. No sanitized chart_pattern deployment snapshot was available. Every field is either the request in the issue (Hyperliquid perps, BTC, ETH, SOL, HYPE and BNB at 30m and 1h, trailing_tp_ratchet_regime close) or a default the scheduler resolves (regime classifier ADX period 14, the default ratchet ladders through use_defaults, the default per-regime trailing stop table through trailing_stop_atr_mult_regime use_defaults, atr_method, leverage 1, capital 1000, paper mode). closed_bar_decisions true is an explicit assumption that makes the live decision frame the last closed candles. build-arms sets direction and htf_gate_factor per arm; nothing here is copied from another strategy's configuration.",
